# ArabianPay Core - Full Codebase Context for AI Assistants

## Project Overview
ArabianPay is a **B2B Buy-Now-Pay-Later (BNPL) fintech platform** built for the Saudi Arabian market. It connects **suppliers** (merchants/sellers) with **customers** (buyers/businesses) through a credit-based purchasing system with instalment payments, risk scoring, collections, and regulatory compliance (SIMAH, Nafith/SANAD, SingleView Open Banking, Nafath identity verification).

**Tech Stack:**
- **Backend:** Laravel 12 (PHP 8.2+)
- **Frontend:** Livewire 3 + Blade templates + Tailwind CSS + Vite
- **Auth:** Laravel Sanctum + Jetstream + Fortify 2FA + Passkeys (Spatie) + Microsoft SSO
- **Realtime:** Laravel Reverb (WebSockets) for chat & notifications
- **DB:** MySQL (encrypted fields via `joelwmale/laravel-encryption`)
- **Permissions:** Spatie Laravel Permission (roles, departments, permissions)
- **Localization:** mcamara/laravel-localization (Arabic/English, translatable models via Astrotomic)
- **PDF/Excel:** DomPDF + Maatwebsite Excel
- **Firebase:** Push notifications via FCM
- **Activity Logging:** Spatie Activity Log

---

## Database Architecture & Entity Relationships

### Core User System

**User** (central entity - all actors share this table)
- Fields: `first_name`, `last_name`, `user_type`, `email`, `role`, `business_name`, `phone_number`, `merchant_id`, `main_user_id`, `department_id`, `is_manager`, `country_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `password`, `sensitive_permissions`, `status`
- Encrypted: first_name, last_name, email, business_name, phone_number
- Soft deletes enabled
- `user_type` distinguishes: admin, supplier (merchant), customer, employee
- Relationships:
  - hasOne **Merchant** (supplier profile)
  - hasOne **Customer** (buyer profile)
  - hasOne **CustomerCreditLimit**
  - hasMany **Products**, **Coupons**, **PickupPoints**
  - hasMany **Orders** (as buyer via user_id, as seller via seller_id)
  - hasMany **Transactions** (as buyer and seller)
  - hasMany **SchedulePayments** (as buyer and seller)
  - hasMany **Payments** (as buyer and seller)
  - hasMany **Wallets** (as buyer and seller)
  - hasMany **SupportTickets**, **RefundRequests**, **ProductWishlists**
  - hasMany **TransferRequests** (from_user_id, to_user_id)
  - hasMany **DeviceTokens**, **Notifications**, **SupplierBanks**
  - hasOne **NafathVerification**
  - belongsTo **Country**, **State**, **City**, **Department**

**Merchant** (supplier/seller profile)
- Fields: `user_id`, `assigned_to`, `business_type_id`, `business_category_id`, `goverment_data`, `cr_number`, `pos_revenue`, `vat_register`, `vat_register_number`, `owner_name`, `owner_iqama_number`, `status`, `term_status`, various policy fields, `balady_certificate`
- Encrypted: cr_number, pos_revenue, vat_register_number, owner_name, owner_iqama_number
- Soft deletes enabled
- JSON casts: payment_history, simah_api_response, external_credit_data
- belongsTo **User**, **BusinessType**, **BusinessCategory**

**Customer** (buyer profile)
- Fields: `user_id`, `assigned_to`, `package_id`, `business_type_id`, `business_category_id`, `id_number`, `id_owner`, `cr_number`, `tax_number`, `cr_data`, `check_nafath`, `nafath_data`, `date_of_birth`, `purchasing_volume`, `purchasing_natures`, `status`
- Encrypted: id_number, id_owner, cr_number, tax_number
- belongsTo **User**, **Package**, **BusinessType**, **BusinessCategory**

### Product & Catalog

**Product**
- Fields: `name`, `slug`, `added_by`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `brand_id`, `thumbnail`, `photos`, `tags`, `variants`, `sku`, `description`, `unit_price`, `purchase_price`, `discount`, `discount_type`, `current_stock`, `unit`, `weight`, `min_qty`, `low_stock_quantity`, `tax`, `shipping_cost`, `published`, `approved`, `featured`, `rating`, `views`, `refundable`
- JSON casts: tags, variants
- belongsTo **User** (seller), **Category**, **Brand**
- Translatable

**Category** - hierarchical product categories (translatable)
**Brand** - product brands (translatable)
**Attribute** / **AttributeValue** - product attributes system (translatable)
**ProductAttribute** - pivot between Product and AttributeValue

### Order & Payment Flow

**Checkout** (groups orders into a single purchase session)
- Fields: `user_id`, `pool_id`
- hasMany **Orders**, **SchedulePayments**
- hasManyThrough **Payments** via SchedulePayments
- belongsTo **InvestmentPool** (funding source)
- hasOne **Transaction**

**Order** (individual order per seller within a checkout)
- Fields: `user_id`, `seller_id`, `uuid`, `checkout_id`, `pickup_point_id`, `product_details`, shipping fields, `payment_type`, `shipping_cost`, `payment_status`, `grand_total`, `commission_amount`, `commission_percent`, `coupon_discount`, `code`, `tracking`, `delivery_status`, `general_status`, `invoice_number`, `settlement_id`, `rejection_reason`
- belongsTo **User** (buyer), **User** (seller), **Checkout**, **Settlement**
- hasMany **SchedulePayments**, **Payments**, **Wallets**, **OrderActionLogs**

**Transaction** (high-level credit/loan record per checkout)
- Fields: `uuid`, `user_id`, `seller_id`, `order_id`, `plan_id`, `loan_amount`, `loan_start_date`, `loan_end_date`, `loan_term`, `subscription_fees`, `credit_limit_at_time`, `remaining_credit_limit`, `payment_status`, `settlement_status`, `general_status`
- belongsTo **User** (buyer + seller), **Order**, **InstalmentPlan**

**SchedulePayment** (individual instalment within a checkout)
- Fields: `user_id`, `seller_id`, `order_id`, `checkout_id`, `assigned_to`, `instalment_number`, `amount`, `due_date`, `paid_date`, `payment_status`, `late_fee`, `days_overdue`
- belongsTo **User** (buyer + seller), **Order**
- hasOne **Payment**, hasOne **Promise**, hasMany **PartialPayments**, hasMany **Claims**

**Payment** (actual payment record when money moves)
- Fields: `user_id`, `schedule_payment_id`, `checkout_id`, `seller_id`, `order_id`, `amount`, `payment_details`, `invoice_number`, `txn_code`, `tax_number`, `payment_status`
- belongsTo **User**, **SchedulePayment**, **Checkout**, **Order**

**Wallet** (ledger entries for money movement)
- Fields: `user_id`, `seller_id`, `order_id`, `instalment_id`, `transaction_type` (user_payment, loan_disbursment, seller_payment), `amount`, `balance_after`, `status`
- belongsTo **User** (buyer + seller), **Order**, **InstalmentPlan**

### Financial System

**InstalmentPlan** (BNPL plan templates)
- Fields: `name`, `description`, `number_of_instalments`, `interval_days`, `admin_fee_percentage`, `late_fee_percentage`, `min_amount`, `max_amount`, `status`
- Translatable
- hasMany **Transactions**, **Wallets**, **Customers**

**Settlement** (batch payment to suppliers)
- Fields: `supplier_user_id`, `period_start`, `period_end`, `total_sales`, `total_commission`, `total_deductions`, `net_amount`, `status`, `notes`, `created_by`, `paid_by`, `approved_by`, `approved_at`, `paid_at`
- belongsTo **User** (supplier, creator, payer, approver)
- hasMany **Orders**, **SupplierPayouts**

**SupplierPayout** (individual payout line items within a settlement)
- Fields: `supplier_id`, `order_id`, `settlement_id`, `gross_amount`, `commission_amount`, `net_amount`, `status`, `paid_at`, `reference`, `created_by`
- belongsTo **Merchant**, **Order**, **Settlement**, **User** (creator)

**InvestmentPool** (funding pools that finance checkouts)
- Fields: `name`, `total_amount`, `used_amount`, `available_amount`, `start_date`, `end_date`, `status`, `description`
- hasMany **Checkouts**
- hasManyThrough **Payments**, **SchedulePayments** via Checkouts

**FAccounts / FEntry / FTransaction** - Double-entry accounting system (financial accounts, journal entries, transactions)

**ExpenseSetting** - expense configuration

### Credit & Collections

**CustomerCreditLimit** - per-customer credit limits
- belongsTo **User**

**Claim** (collection claim on overdue payments)
- Fields: `schedule_payment_id`, `user_id`, `assigned_to`, `type`, `status`, `priority`, `amount`, `notes`, `attempts`, `last_attempt_at`, `resolved_at`, `resolution_notes`
- belongsTo **SchedulePayment**, **User**

**Promise** (promise-to-pay commitments)
- Fields: `schedule_payment_id`, `user_id`, `promised_date`, `promised_amount`, `status`, `notes`
- belongsTo **SchedulePayment**, **User**

**PartialPayment** (partial payments on instalments)
- Fields: `schedule_payment_id`, `amount`, `paid_date`, `status`, `notes`
- belongsTo **SchedulePayment**

**DunningTemplate** - collection letter templates
**SchedulePaymentReminder** - payment reminder records

### Risk & Compliance

**Risk** - risk register entries
**RiskScore** - merchant/customer risk scores
**RiskWeight** - configurable risk scoring weights
**RiskManagement** - risk management records
**RealTimeAlert** - real-time risk/fraud alerts
**CaseManagement** - compliance case tracking

**SimahReport** - Saudi Credit Bureau (SIMAH) report storage
**LeanReport** - Lean open banking report storage
**CrValidation** - commercial registration validation records
**NafathVerification** - Nafath national identity verification
**Sanad** - Nafith promissory notes (SANAD e-notes)

**AuditLog / AuditTrail** - system audit logging
**SensitiveDataApproval** - approval workflow for sensitive data access

### Geography & Localization

**Country** / **State** / **City** - hierarchical geography (all translatable)
- Country hasMany States, State hasMany Cities
- Used for user addresses, shipping, SANAD issuance

**BusinessType** / **BusinessCategory** - business classification (translatable)

### Support & Communication

**SupportTicket** - customer/supplier support tickets
**ChatMessage** - internal real-time chat between users
**Notification** - in-app notifications
**DeviceToken** - FCM push notification tokens
**Note** - internal notes on users/accounts

### Access Control

**Role** (Spatie Permission) - user roles
**Department** - organizational departments
**SupplierRole** - supplier-specific roles
- Pivot: department_role, department_has_permissions
**LoginAttempt** - login attempt tracking
**UserConsent** - user consent records
**Approval** - general approval workflow

### Other

**Coupon** - discount coupons
**Package** - customer tier packages (translatable)
**PickupPoint** - order pickup locations
**ProductWishlist** - customer wishlists
**RefundRequest** - refund requests on orders
**TransferRequest** - internal fund transfer requests
**Media** - uploaded media/files
**Setting** - system settings key-value store
**ShopSetting** - per-merchant shop configuration
**Branch** - merchant branch locations
**UserSearch** - search history tracking
**Otp** - one-time password records
**LowStockNotification** - low inventory alerts
**Membership** - membership records
**OrderActionLog** - order status change history
**SupplierBank** - supplier bank account details
**CustomerBank** - customer bank account details

