## Key Business Flows

### 1. BNPL Purchase Flow
```
Customer browses products → Adds to cart → Checkout created
→ Checkout links to InvestmentPool (funding source)
→ Orders created per seller → Transaction record created
→ SchedulePayments generated based on InstalmentPlan
→ Each SchedulePayment has due_date and amount
→ Customer pays instalments → Payment records created
→ Wallet entries track money flow
→ Settlement batches collect supplier payouts
```

### 2. Supplier Onboarding Flow
```
User registers as supplier → Merchant profile created
→ CR validation (CrValidation + WathqService)
→ Nafath identity verification
→ SIMAH credit check → Risk scoring
→ Admin review & approval → Status: active
→ Products listed → Orders received
```

### 3. Customer Onboarding Flow
```
User registers as customer → Customer profile created
→ Package selected (credit tier)
→ Nafath verification → SIMAH report
→ Credit assessment → CustomerCreditLimit set
→ Can start purchasing on credit
```

### 4. Collections Flow
```
SchedulePayment overdue → RealTimeAlert generated
→ DunningTemplate-based reminders sent
→ Claims created for collection agents
→ Promise-to-pay negotiated → Promise record
→ PartialPayments accepted if applicable
→ Case escalation via CaseManagement
```

### 5. Settlement Flow
```
Period closes → Settlement generated per supplier
→ Orders aggregated → Commission calculated
→ SupplierPayouts created per order
→ Admin approval → Bank transfer file generated
→ Payout marked as paid
```

