## Third-Party Integrations

| Service | Purpose | Service Class |
|---------|---------|---------------|
| **SIMAH** | Saudi Credit Bureau reports & scoring | `SimahService` |
| **Nafith/SANAD** | Electronic promissory notes | `NafithService` |
| **SingleView** | Open Banking (account aggregation, KYC, credit/income/expense checks) | `SingleViewService` |
| **Lean** | Open Banking (bank statements, entities) | `LeanService` |
| **Wathq** | Commercial Registration validation | `WathqService` |
| **ClickPay** | Payment gateway | `ClickPayService` |
| **Firebase/FCM** | Push notifications | `FirebaseService` |
| **Microsoft SSO** | Employee authentication | `MicrosoftController` |

