## Directory Structure

```
app/
├── Http/Controllers/         # 80+ controllers
│   ├── Admin/               # Checkout, Claims, InvestmentPools, Payouts, Settlements
│   ├── Auth/                # Session auth, Microsoft SSO
│   ├── Financial/           # Accounts, Transactions, Dashboard, Expenses
│   ├── settings/            # Risk weights, System settings
│   └── ...                  # All other domain controllers
├── Models/                  # 90+ Eloquent models
├── Services/                # Business logic services
│   ├── Finance/             # Settlement, Expense, Payout, Supplier finance
│   └── ...                  # SIMAH, Lean, Nafith, Risk, Firebase, etc.
├── Traits/                  # LogsModelActions, etc.
├── Events/                  # TypingEvent, etc.
├── Enums/                   # (not yet created)
database/
├── migrations/              # 90+ migrations (2025-04 through 2026-01)
routes/
├── web.php                  # Main admin panel routes (~790 lines)
├── api.php                  # API routes (SingleView, Nafith, SIMAH testing)
├── setting.php              # Settings panel routes
├── test.php                 # Test routes
resources/views/             # Blade templates
config/                      # Laravel config files
```

